ion_work_times:PXt,reset_filter_element_work_time:LXt,reset_filter_work_time:jXt,reset_main_brush_work_time:FXt,reset_sensor_dirty_time:BXt,reset_side_brush_work_time:WXt,resetConsumables_description:qXt,resume_segment_clean:HXt,resume_zoned_clean:UXt,"roborock adapter settings":"roborock的适配器设置",rss:GXt,rtsp:VXt,save_furnitures:XXt,sensor_dirty_time:KXt,set_carpet_clean_mode:JXt,set_carpet_mode:YXt,set_clean_sequence:ZXt,set_custom_mode:QXt,set_dust_collection_mode:eKt,set_dust_collection_switch_status:tKt,set_mop_mode:nKt,set_smart_wash_params:rKt,set_wash_towel_mode:oKt,set_water_box_custom_mode:aKt,side_brush_life:sKt,side_brush_work_time:iKt,"Saved program execution":"执行已保存的程序","Local adapter queue":"适配器本地队列","Cloud like Roborock app":"像 Roborock 应用一样使用云端","Local: runs the saved scene locally from its Roborock scene steps and keeps the local queue/resume. Cloud: starts the saved scene through Roborock cloud like the app. No automatic fallback between modes.":"本地：根据 Roborock 场景步骤在本地运行已保存的场景，并保留本地队列和恢复功能。云端：像 Roborock 应用一样通过 Roborock 云端启动已保存的场景。两种模式之间不会自动切换。",split_segment:cKt,start_cleaning_time:lKt,start_type:uKt,state:dKt,stop_segment_clean:pKt,stop_zoned_clean:hKt,strainer_work_times:fKt,stream_html:_Kt,stream_mp4:mKt,switch_map_mode:gKt,"United States":"United States",unsave_map_flag:yKt,unsave_map_reason:vKt,"Update interval":"更新间隔","Update interval while cleaning":"清扫期间的更新间隔","Seconds between two polls while the robot is cleaning, returning or washing. Lower values make position, area and progress follow more closely, but every poll is a request: they cost network traffic and load on both the robot and ioBroker. Below about 3 seconds the gain is barely visible.":"机器人清扫、回充或洗拖布期间两次轮询之间的秒数。数值越小，位置、面积和进度跟得越紧，但每次轮询都是一次请求：会消耗网络流量并增加机器人和 ioBroker 的负载。低于约 3 秒后几乎看不出改善。","Maximum wait after failed polls":"轮询失败后的最长等待时间","After a failed poll the adapter waits 30 seconds, then doubles the wait after each further failure, up to this limit. A low value notices a returning robot sooner but keeps retrying against an unreachable device; a high value keeps the log and the network quiet during a longer outage.":"轮询失败后适配器等待 30 秒，此后每再失败一次等待时间翻倍，直到该上限。数值较低能更早发现重新上线的机器人，但会持续向不可达的设备重试；数值较高则在较长的故障期间保持日志和网络安静。","Live map update":"地图实时更新","Seconds between two checks for map changes while the robot is cleaning; while it stands still the adapter waits twice as long. The check itself is a small request that asks only what changed, and a complete map is transferred only when something actually did - so a low value costs far less than it looks, but it is still one request per interval on the robot, the network and ioBroker. Robots that do not offer the incremental map have to transfer the whole map every time and are therefore never checked faster than every 5 seconds. 0 switches the live update off; the map is then only refreshed by the normal poll.":"机器人清扫时两次地图变化检查之间的秒数；静止时适配器等待的时间加倍。检查本身是一个只询问哪些内容发生变化的小请求，只有在确实发生变化时才会传输完整地图——因此较小的值的代价远低于表面所见，但仍然是每个间隔向机器人、网络和 ioBroker 发出的一次请求。不支持增量地图的机器人每次都必须传输整张地图，因此检查间隔永远不会短于 5 秒。0 表示关闭实时更新；此时地图仅由常规轮询刷新。","Seconds between two polls while the robot is idle or docked. Nothing changes in this state, so a long interval costs nothing; a short one only adds network traffic and load on the robot and on ioBroker.":"机器人空闲或停靠在基站时两次轮询之间的秒数。此状态下没有任何变化，因此较长的间隔没有代价；较短的间隔只会增加网络流量以及机器人和 ioBroker 的负载。",wash_count:bKt,wash_phase:wKt,wash_ready:kKt,wash_status:$Kt,water_shortage_status:SKt,webserverPort:xKt,"Account & connection":"账户与连接",Map:"地图",Advanced:CKt,"Local operation":"本地运行",'With "Email + 2FA Code" Roborock sends a six digit code by email. There is no input field for it here: enter the code into the state roborock.<instance>.loginCode within 15 minutes of starting the adapter.':"选择“Email + 2FA Code”时，Roborock 会通过邮件发送六位验证码。此处没有输入框：请在适配器启动后 15 分钟内将验证码写入状态 roborock.<instance>.loginCode。","Connection mode":"连接模式","Cloud and local":"云端与本地","Local only (no cloud contact)":"仅本地（不连接云端）","Local only: the adapter never contacts the Roborock cloud. This requires manually configured devices with duid and localKey. Cloud based functions stay unavailable in this mode - map retrieval currently needs the cloud connection, as do saved scenes, firmware information and camera streaming. There is no automatic fallback to the cloud.":"仅本地：适配器绝不连接 Roborock 云端。这需要手动配置带有 duid 和 localKey 的设备。此模式下云端功能不可用——地图获取目前需要云端连接，已保存的场景、固件信息和摄像头串流同样如此。不会自动回退到云端。","Manual devices (JSON)":"手动设备（JSON）",'JSON array, one object per device: {"duid": "...", "localKey": "...", "ip": "192.168.1.50", "pv": "1.0"}. Optional: name, model, category, sn. The localKey is a 16 character device secret that only exists in the Roborock cloud device list and cannot be derived locally; it changes only when the device is paired again. Log in once with your account to read it, then keep it here. It is stored encrypted and never written to the log.':'JSON 数组，每台设备一个对象：{"duid": "...", "localKey": "...", "ip": "192.168.1.50", "pv": "1.0"}。可选：name、model、category、sn。localKey 是 16 个字符的设备密钥，仅存在于 Roborock 云端设备列表中，无法在本地推导；只有重新配对时才会改变。请用账户登录一次以读取该密钥，然后保存在此处。它以加密方式存储，绝不会写入日志。',"Search devices in network":"搜索网络中的设备","Listens for device broadcasts and reports duid, IP address and protocol version, so a manual entry can be created without a cloud account. The adapter instance must be running.":"监听设备广播并报告 duid、IP 地址和协议版本，以便在没有云端账户的情况下创建手动条目。适配器实例必须处于运行状态。","Listen for device broadcasts (UDP 58866)":"监听设备广播（UDP 58866）","Off: only devices with a statically configured IP address are used. Helpful when broadcasts are filtered (VLAN, WLAN client isolation, LXC or Docker bridges).":"关闭：仅使用配置了静态 IP 地址的设备。当广播被过滤时（VLAN、无线客户端隔离、LXC 或 Docker 网桥）很有用。","Network interface for discovery":"用于设备发现的网络接口","JSON array of { duid, localKey, ip, pv }. The localKey is a device secret and is stored encrypted.":"由 { duid, localKey, ip, pv } 组成的 JSON 数组。localKey 是设备密钥，以加密方式存储。",ui_device:EKt,ui_floor:TKt,ui_fan_power:AKt,ui_mop_mode:IKt,ui_water_flow:OKt,ui_clean_mode_vac_and_mop:RKt,